<description>&lt;p&gt;JNIM militants have attacked 30 locations across Mali, prompting calls for dialogue, while gunmen in Niger state have killed a village head, several others, and five worshippers in a mosque attack. Fulani civilians have been killed in reprisal attacks after a village leader’s murder, with dozens reported dead. Benin is stepping up operations against jihadists near the Nigeria border. The Sahel jihadist insurgency caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTFBsbi1oTkZzVU82UGNINGhsTjBMdnl5cUxSMVFlSWVMT2Q3N1VxOERmdFpaRDI1SF9wSHRZY3B5NzY0azB6dzRwSTQ0SDl6dEpQVkgxMDlnTFFrdkZhU2tEMVozNXhONDVvMVR6OVRxU0lLb0x0QWln?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNZTlSMHhXOU8yeFh3RlR2bjZKN1kwTmRlenhJdHJzbmVKY2JoV3c3MkYyWVU1VHRxdEgxeGpXaDNmWm1RMXkxRC1iM0dLb2hXWnYxRk51Y0N5dnlVaUJMVTdzaXFRanFVaV9sWjF1OS1OR0x0QVhwbDBaR0M2Sm9hdFVDRk9waHJ1N1Y4dVZOcS1iMHN1YkkwZDR3LS12SzdkMTJTcFJmRlc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sight Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQMC1WaGllN3FwOUNZTHc4Qm9NY19WMHVwNXo4amJ1NXBiRXVFRkMwdEt1OExnOWxTdHg1aDE1M3VnQ3c5MFJpVjlITXBzSkg3b0gzUlRaSmk5aEl1UzJVajRKcTY5bE1hZWV5REt0OXBZRXFlekJrVTlrRUo3M2VReENJVFJMczA?oc=5&quot;&gt;dailystruggle.ng&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNTWZDeUh2WVVkSG01U0x2UXhXcnctWFRMdUoyY3IzN0xOejVackxFV1ZFZEtfVmlPWmJaZlVsaWk0Sno3R0VRRE5TeW9vczZrLVQxbmNsR1pEWUVjYng5Q2FjeVJ3d3hKZnh3b2djV0JuNzYtdFdDVVc2OUM3QWF5d1pjbnhwdnNORjZURng2bTNhUWRK?oc=5&quot;&gt;Crime Fighters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQU29VYkRzZWJrTDQwMmRGbThPNTZtQjBaSXQ5Mm5BVl9ReC1Cd2IwY0dHYWZob1lFUlFCVGNPcjBUX2VxeDNJaXZ5bF9vMi1hWWY5X1RyMkkwYjVaeWZfTGsxbnZ